Result: the non-cuBLASLt-GEMM fraction is 14.2-14.6% of device busy at
2048x4096 and device idle between kernels is 0.13-0.14% under graph
replay. Recommendation is DO NOT BUILD S6, which the roadmap admits as an
outcome. Two claims verified here before accepting the verdict: Epilogue
appears zero times in x/cudaplan's non-test sources while x/cublasltx
exposes it (cublasltx.go:230, epilogue.go:45), and the transformer block
in x/cudaplan/integration_test.go compiles with WithPeakWorkspaceBudget
alone -- no WithDevice -- so it never executes at this revision and the
fraction is measured against kernels the agent supplied at cudaplan's own
geometry. Disclosed by the agent rather than smuggled.

